                                                <h1 class='postTitle'>Resisting Neoliberalism: The Path to Global South Autonomy
                                                </h1>
                                                <div class='postMeta'>
                                                    <div class='postAuthorAndTimestamp'>
                                                        <span class='authorImage'>
